{"images":["data:image/webp;base64,"],"messages":[{"content":"Sixty adults with gum disease were asked the number of times per week they used to floss before their diagnosis. The (incomplete) results are shown in table below. <image> What percent flossed at most three times per week?\n\n(A) 90.25%\n(B) 94.21%\n(C) 93.33%\n(D) 95.50%\n\nAnswer with the option's letter from the given choices directly.","role":"user"}]}